   "title": "Infertility: no pregnancy after 1 YEAR of regular, unprotected intercourse · investigate BOTH partners",
   "lines": [
    "work up at 12 MONTHS if under 35 · at 6 MONTHS if 35 or over · IMMEDIATELY if a known cause (e.g. irregular cycles)",
    "female alone 41% · male alone 24% · both 24% · unexplained 11% · 85% conceive by 1 year"
   ]
  },
